  "details": "Imagine your home world was a spaceship. You set a destination (world) and you leave your spaceship. At the destination, you spawn walking out of a object. You're able to pick up your spaceship and put it in your item inventory. When it's time to head back, you set the item like a portal spawn, it appears, and you walk in, making the item disappear in the world you left.\n\nWould this kind of thing be possible once you can create custom items?",
